{"id":"7b18d50e9dafc3fd","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-prop-forcing-definition.md","title":"Downward Persistence of Forcing","display":"prop-forcing-definition — Downward Persistence of Forcing","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-forcing-definition","aliases":["58-prop-forcing-definition"],"display":"prop-forcing-definition — Downward Persistence of Forcing","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-forcing-definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-forcing-definition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-forcing-definition — Downward Persistence of Forcing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md\">../batch06/58-df-ctm.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,p,q,\\Sigma_{\\in},\\varphi,\\vec\\tau\\in V\">\\(M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,p,q,\\Sigma_{\\in},\\varphi,\\vec\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CTM}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{CTM}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (model and poset predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (canonical forcing-relation predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}definition}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land P\\in M\\land\\leq_P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\n\\forall p,q\\in P\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_{\\in})\\cap M)\\;\n\\forall\\vec\\tau\\in M^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n\\Bigl((\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P))\n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,q,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}definition}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land P\\in M\\land\\leq_P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\n\\forall p,q\\in P\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_{\\in})\\cap M)\\;\n\\forall\\vec\\tau\\in M^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n\\Bigl((\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P))\n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,q,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both the ground model and the forcing order are supplied to the canonical six-place forcing relation. The CTM predicate also receives its required theory parameter <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Semantically, the forcing theorem identifies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\Vdash_P\\varphi\">\\(p\\Vdash_P\\varphi\\)</span> with truth of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> in every relevant generic extension whose generic filter contains <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"911508dbd8495663","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,p,q,\\Sigma_{\\in},\\varphi,\\vec\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CTM}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}definition}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land P\\in M\\land\\leq_P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n&\\quad\\to\n\\forall p,q\\in P\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_{\\in})\\cap M)\\;\n\\forall\\vec\\tau\\in M^{<\\omega}\\;\n\\Bigl((\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P))\n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,q,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P,\\leq_P)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"p\\Vdash_P\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false}],"bytes":1552,"backlinks":[{"id":"7571e570a84c5e37","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3961","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-prop-forcing-definition.md|58-prop-forcing-definition]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["66d43bb76d055059","911508dbd8495663","65418b505fc53093","d3f859dbdd37f018"]}